Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:10:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] PlaitOS: Slim Recents settings

A Slim Recents page (on/off, panel side, screenshots, apps shown, panel
width, free memory, and how to use it), linked from the PlaitOS rows of
3-button navigation and from the Buttons tab. The keys are read by
Slim Recents in Launcher3 (SlimSettings) and reset with the other
PlaitOS settings. Off by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3ssZ7eH5QDg4P9AiP
